Ke7 6. Kf5 Kf8 7. Ke5 b5 $1 { Just in time, enabling ...Na6 before White plays 8.Kd6. } 8. Kd4 Na6 9. Kc3 Nxb4 $1 10. Kxb4 Kg7 11. Kxb5 Kh8 12. Kc5 
